AIRY","change_pct":20.18,"index_change_pct":18.69,"change_pct_excl_additional":11.11,"n_holiday_days":34,"n_holiday_store_days":408,"n_holiday_days_excl_additional":20},{"family":"FROZEN FOODS","change_pct":226.9,"index_change_pct":264.99,"change_pct_excl_additional":-0.62,"n_holiday_days":34,"n_holiday_store_days":408,"n_holiday_days_excl_additional":20},{"family":"GROCERY I","change_pct":27.56,"index_change_pct":27.82,"change_pct_excl_additional":8.84,"n_holiday_days":34,"n_holiday_store_days":408,"n_holiday_days_excl_additional":20},{"family":"PERSONAL CARE","change_pct":19.36,"index_change_pct":18.5,"change_pct_excl_additional":17.28,"n_holiday_days":34,"n_holiday_store_days":408,"n_holiday_days_excl_additional":20},{"family":"PRODUCE","change_pct":13.97,"index_change_pct":18.31,"change_pct_excl_additional":1.58,"n_holiday_days":34,"n_holiday_store_days":408,"n_holiday_days_excl_additional":20}],"notes":["Real data from Corporacion Favorita (Ecuador), Kaggle 'Store Sales - Time Series Forecasting'. Scope: 12 stores x 8 families = 96 daily series.","All EDA uses history 2015-06-01..2017-06-27 (up to the last calibration target date). The holdout period 2017-06-28..2017-08-15 is not used, so nothing here can leak into model evaluation.","Sales are observed sales, not unconstrained demand: there is no stock-out data, so lost sales are invisible.","Closed store-days (25 Dec and 1 Jan, chain-wide) are missing (null), not zero, and are excluded from means.","weekly.family_index: equal-weighted family index per complete Monday-Sunday week = plain mean over the family's 12 store series of each series' weekly index (mean daily sales over the week's open days / the series' mean daily sales 2015-06-01..2017-02-06 x 100). 100 = an average training-period day. No units.","dow_profile: per family, plain mean over its 12 series of each series' weekday mean index, normalised so Mon..Sun average 1; national days off excluded.","volatility: cv = coefficient of variation of daily sales on open days (includes the weekday pattern); cv_weekly uses complete-week totals.","onpromotion is the NUMBER of promoted items in a family/store/day. There is no discount depth or price. Promotion figures are associations, not causal uplift; mean_index compares each day with the same store-family's average for that month. Promoted-item counts and sales levels are not published (Kaggle rules).","holiday_effect: national days off (Holiday not transferred, Transfer, Bridge, Additional) vs normal days (no day off of any locale matched to the store's city/state, no Work Day, no Event, outside the earthquake month). change_pct compares mean sales on holiday vs normal days (levels not published); it does not control for weekday mix; n_holiday_days = distinct dates. National 'Additional' days are mostly the Christmas run-up (21-26 Dec, 31 Dec), which dominates FROZEN FOODS; change_pct_excl_additional removes them. The weekday-matched holiday analogue is in ecuador_analogue.json.","The 2016-04-16 earthquake month (2016-04-16..2016-05-15) is kept in the data but excluded from normal-day baselines."]}